  "Great Guide": "",
  "{{A}} has [Cadenza] and [Ardhanari] two {{B}} skills. At the start of battle, if Makoto's {{B}} Energy is below $1, restore to $2 {{B}} Energy. \\nWhen Makoto receives a buff/healing/shielding from allies, gain $3 <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stack for $5 turns. Makoto can only gain $4 <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stack from this effect before the start of next turn. Stacks up to $6 times. \\nWhen Makoto has <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link>, increase Pierce by $7/$8/$9 (effect increases at level 1/50/70).": "",
  "Born from Coincidence": "",
  "When using [Melodic Blaze], deal bonus damage ($1 hit). \\nWhen using [Moonlit Hymn], increase party's Pierce by $2 for $3 turns. \\nWhen using [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze] at $4 <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks, increase Makoto's Crit Rate by $5.": "",
  "Unwavering Heart": "",
  "At the start of Makoto's turn, if <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> reached $1 stacks, automatically use [Moonlit Hymn]. This effect has a 1 turn cooldown.": "",
