  "The Promise": "",
  "When {{A}} uses any {{B}}, activate the other {{B}}. When spending <link=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link> to deal damage with [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze], increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $1. \\nWhen {{A}} first receives fatal damage, his HP cannot drop below $2 until the end of his next turn, then enter near death, Makoto will faint when his next turn ends. If Makoto's HP is restored above $3 Max HP during near death, remove near death.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to <color=#FFFF00>$1</color> foe equal to $3 of ATK ($2 hits), and gain $4 [Moon Phase] stacks for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times. When spending [Moon Phase] to deal damage with [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze], increase the skill multiplier by $7 for $8 turns.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to $1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK ($2 hits), and gain $4 <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times. When spending <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> to deal damage with [Scarlet: Devouring Blaze], increase the skill multiplier by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns.": "",
