  "Use condition: When Makoto has at least $1 [Moon Phase] stacks. \\nSpend all [Moon Phase], for each [Moon Phase] stack spent, deal Fire damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $2 of ATK. \\nAlso spend all [Special Moon Phase], for each [Special Moon Phase] stack spent, deal Fire damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $3 of ATK. When this skill is used at $4 [Moon Phase] stacks, increase Makoto's Pierce by $5 and DMG Dealt by $6.": "",
  "Use condition: When Makoto has at least $1 <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks. \\nSpend all <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link>, for each <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stack spent, deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. \\nAlso spend all <link=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link>, for each <link=\"s|241\"><u>[Special Moon Phase]</u></link> stack spent, deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK. When this skill is used at $4 <link=\"s|240\"><u>[Moon Phase]</u></link> stacks, increase Makoto's Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> and DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>.": "",
