  "r:\"Deal Fire damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\. Also, gain (\\d+) <link\\=\\\"s\\|(\\d+)\\\"><u>Moon Phase</u></link> stacks\\. This effect lasts for (\\d+) turns, and stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\nAlso, when spending Moon Phase to use Scarlet Hades, increase skill multiplier by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Pluck the strings of the lyre to unleash the flames of the soul, dealing Fire damage to an enemy\\.</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>, and increase Makoto's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, gain (\\d+) <link\\=\\\"s\\|(\\d+)\\\"><u>Moon Phase</u></link> stacks\\. This effect lasts for (\\d+) turns, and stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Burn the fear that dwells within you to empower your allies, increasing the party's critical damage and your own Attack\\.</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Can be activated with (\\d+) or more <link\\=\\\"s\\|(\\d+)\\\"><u>Moon Phase</u></link> stacks\\. Spend all Moon Phase stacks, and deal Fire damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Makoto's Attack \\(1 hit per stack spent\\)\\. Afterwards, spend all <link\\=\\\"s\\|(\\d+)\\\"><u>Full Moon</u></link> stacks, and deal Fire damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Makoto's Attack \\(1 hit per stack spent\\)\\.\\nWhen this skill is activated with (\\d+) Moon Phase stacks, increase Makoto's pierce rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>, and increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The brilliance of each passing day becomes a blazing fireball, dealing Fire damage to an enemy\\.</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Ardhanari：Can be activated when Theurgy Gauge is at (\\d+)\\. Deal Fire damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Makoto's Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\.\\nAlso, gain (\\d+) <link\\=\\\"s\\|(\\d+)\\\"><u>Full Moon</u></link> stack\\. This effect lasts (\\d+) turns, and stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\nCadenza：Can be activated when Theurgy Gauge is at (\\d+)\\. Increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>, and increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Also, gain (\\d+) <link\\=\\\"s\\|(\\d+)\\\"><u>Full Moon</u></link> stack\\. This effect lasts (\\d+) turns, and stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Fire damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nAssist：Increase (\\d+) ally's Attack by (\\d+)% for (\\d+) turn\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"After activating a Theurgy, increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Increase Attack of SEES members by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> more\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When receiving buff, healing, or shield skill effects from an ally \\(excluding effects that also target foes\\), increase critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\"": "",
  "Makoto has 2 Theurgy: Cadenza and Ardhanari. At the start of battle, if Makoto's Theurgy Gauge is below 35, fill up to 35.\\nWhen receiving buff, healing, or shield skill effects from an ally (excluding effects that also target foes), gain 1 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>Moon Phase</u></link> stack (up to 1 stack per turn). This effect lasts for 2 turns, and stacks up to 4 times.\\nWith Moon Phase, increase pierce rate by 4%/8%/12% (effect changes at Lv. 1/50/70, respectively).": "",
  "Additional effects are added to the following skills.\\nMelody of Flames: This skill deals 1 more hit of Fire damage.\\nNocturne of Battle: Increase party's pierce rate by 10% for 2 turns.\\nScarlet Hades: When this skill is activated with 4 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>Moon Phase</u></link> stacks, increase Makoto's critical rate by 16%.": "",
  "When Makoto has 4 <link\\=\"s|240\"><u>Moon Phase</u></link> stacks on his action, automatically activate Nocturne of Battle 1 time.\\nCooldown time: 1 turn.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Melody of Flames and Nocturne of Battle by 3.": "",
  "Additional effects are added to the following Theurgy.\\nCadenza: Increase party's damage by 10% more for 2 turns.\\nArdhanari: This skill deals 2 more hits of Fire damage.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Scarlet Hades and Combat Tactics by 3.": "",
  "When Makoto activates a Theurgy, the effects of the other Theurgy are activated at the same time.\\nIncrease skill damage dealt by spending <link\\=\"s|241\"><u>Full Moon</u></link> stacks with Scarlet Hades by 35%.\\nThe first time that Makoto takes fatal damage, he enters a special near-death state and survives with 1 HP, and will be KO'd at the end of the turn. If Makoto's HP is restored above 25%, this state is removed.": "",
  "r:\"Fire dmg to (\\d+) foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk, (\\d+) hits\\)\\. Also, gain (\\d+) Moon Phase \\((\\d+) turns, max (\\d+) stacks\\)\\.\\nAlso, when spending Moon Phase to use Scarlet Hades, increase skill multiplier ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's crit dmg ([\\d\\.]+)%, and increase Makoto's Atk ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nAlso, gain (\\d+) Moon Phase \\((\\d+) turns, max (\\d+) stacks\\)\\.\"": "",
